      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAKE HIS CASH (1) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 1.75 lengths win at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 17.03. Draws the cherry and likes the trip. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. YARRAMUNDI CAMMO (5) recorded two placings in a row before an overdue win last time, scoring by 1.3 lengths (16.81) at this track. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Sure to be thereabouts. IF I COULD (3) goes very well this trip starting 10 times for four wins and four minors. Missed the frame latest (22.81) when fifth over 395m at this track in a Grade 6. Looks suited here and can measure up. PRETTY ESMAY (7) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
